&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-is-openviking&#34;&gt;What is OpenViking
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;OpenViking is an open-source context database for AI agents. It stores memories, resources, and skills as one virtual filesystem under the &lt;code&gt;viking://&lt;/code&gt; protocol, so an agent browses its own context with &lt;code&gt;ls&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;tree&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;find&lt;/code&gt; instead of querying a black-box vector store. Content is processed into three tiers — L0 abstract, L1 overview, L2 details — and loaded on demand. Every retrieval leaves a trajectory you can watch and debug. Full introduction: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.openviking.ai/en/getting-started/01-introduction&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Getting started&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://openviking.ai/studio&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/docs/images/studio-playground.png&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;OpenViking Studio playground&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://openviking.ai/studio&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;OpenViking Studio&lt;/a&gt; playground — a live demo you can open in the browser, no installation required.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;why-openviking&#34;&gt;Why OpenViking
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One filesystem for all context.&lt;/strong&gt; Memories, resources, and skills each get a &lt;code&gt;viking://&lt;/code&gt; URI. Agents locate and manipulate context deterministically, like a developer working with files. → &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.openviking.ai/en/concepts/04-viking-uri&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Viking URI&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.openviking.ai/en/concepts/02-context-types&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Context types&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tiered loading cuts token spend.&lt;/strong&gt; Every entry is processed into L0 (abstract), L1 (overview), and L2 (details) on write, then loaded only as deep as the task requires. → &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.openviking.ai/en/concepts/03-context-layers&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Context layers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Directory recursive retrieval.&lt;/strong&gt; Vector search first locates the highest-scoring directory, then drills down layer by layer, so results arrive with their surrounding context intact. → &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.openviking.ai/en/concepts/07-retrieval&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Retrieval&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Observable retrieval.&lt;/strong&gt; Each query preserves its directory-browsing trajectory. When a result looks wrong, you can see exactly which path produced it. → &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.openviking.ai/en/concepts/07-retrieval&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Retrieval&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sessions become memory.&lt;/strong&gt; After a session commits, OpenViking asynchronously extracts user preferences and agent experience into long-term memory. → &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.openviking.ai/en/concepts/08-session&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Session&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How the pieces fit together: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.openviking.ai/en/concepts/01-architecture&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Architecture&lt;/a&gt;. The thinking behind the design: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://blog.openviking.ai/post/openviking-context-database/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;The Database Paradigm for Context Engineering&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;11
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;12
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;13
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;14
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;15
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;16
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;17
